## 9. Future Changes

Before changing DNS records, check whether the record is being used by:

* GitHub Pages
* Minecraft / Exaroton
* Email
* Any future WindyCraft service
* Other subdomains

Keep a record of every DNS change and its purpose.

**Current principle:**

> Change only the DNS record required for the specific service. Avoid replacing or deleting unrelated records.
